@apiUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1

### get cats
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats

### get cat by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/41

### get cat by id (FAIL: not found)
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/987

### post new cat
POST {{apiUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Tikru",
    "weight": 13,
    "owner": 37,
    "filename": "https://placecats.com/300/200",
    "birthdate": "2022-09-09"
}

### edit existing cat
PUT {{apiUrl}}/cats/60
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "cat_name": "Mosse",
    "weight": 15,
    "owner": 49
}

### delete cat by id
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/cats/64
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### delete cat by id FAIL
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/cats/60

### post new cat from a form
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Maijan kissa
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

6
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="owner"

37
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="dog.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dog.jpg
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2023-10-08
--MyBoundary--

### post new cat with no body FAIL
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### post new cat from a form FAIL
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Mosa
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

6
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="owner"

49
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="dog.jpg"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./dog.jpg
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2023-10-08
--MyBoundary--

